.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-modules 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-modules \- Measure the crate\*(Aqs module graph
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten modules\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Measure the crate\*(Aqs module graph
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-modules\-metrics(1)
Print every module\-graph metric of a source root as one record line
.TP
batten\-modules\-ratchet(1)
Refuse any module\-graph metric worse than the committed record, and tighten the record on improvement
.TP
batten\-modules\-cut(1)
Move a closed set of crate\-root modules into a new sibling package, respelling every path, no shim
.TP
batten\-modules\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
